# SYNTHETIC. Written from RFC 5321 section 4.5.3.1.6. Not a recording.
# The message has a line of 999 octets, one past what DATA carries, so the client stops
# before AUTH with a permanent refusal.

S: 220 smtp.example ESMTP ready
C: EHLO client.example
S: 250-smtp.example Hello
S: 250 AUTH PLAIN
FAIL Refused
